{"c":[{"name":"20260829T190402Z-6371376f562b82e0","text":"QA for warehouse-schema-docs failed: Mermaid %% view comment is invisible in rendered ERD, so session_token_usage is not visually distinguished from tables; Build must make views visibly labeled/styled and add a rendered-output contract.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T190854Z-e3140d8fbabc94db","text":"Warehouse ERD views use Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]; %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes.","type":"note"}]}
